fter the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"title":"Swami"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView":{"title":"Interaction_DragView","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Drags a layer in any direction with momentum and rubber-band bounds. The draggable"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"card responds to touch input via Origami’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"origami.Drag"},{"type":"text","text":" patch, which wires its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"output "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Position"},{"type":"text","text":" to the layer’s transform. When released near the center, the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"card snaps back to its resting position."}],"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Interaction_DragView"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Interaction_DragView"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/onContinueUserActivity(_:perform:)":{"url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/oncontinueuseractivity(_:perform:)","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/onContinueUserActivity(_:perform:)","abstract":[],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","title":"onContinueUserActivity(_:perform:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"onContinueUserActivity","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"